    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="76.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 76.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne on þone geonbryde þe hine slog, þonne ætfealle sio bot þam godfæder, swa ilce swa þæt wite ðam hlaforde deð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If [the decedent], however, was resisting in a fight the one who slew him, the compensation to the godfather is nullified, just as is the fine due to the lord.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he was engaged in a struggle with him who slew him, the godfather shall lose his compensation, just as [in similar circumstances] the lord loses his fine.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ðonne on þone geonbryde þe hine sloh, ðonne ætfealle sio bot ðæm godfæder, swa same swa þæt wite ðam hlaforde deþ.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
